  "hook": {"section": 2, "bar": 0, "notes": 5, "description": "(rest) D5-E5 | B5 held 2 beats = maj7 of Cmaj7 | A5 dotted-quarter = 9th appoggiatura over G6, sighs to G5 | D5 held. Rhythm follows the prosody of 'hel-lo, WORLD': silent downbeat, two eighths on beat 2, long note on beat 3."},
